# Intermediate files left behind by dpkg-buildpackage / debhelper.
# None of these belong in the repository; remove them with `dh_clean`.
#
# The per-package staging directories are listed by name on purpose: a blanket
# "*/" would also swallow debian/source/, where real files live.
files
debhelper-build-stamp
*.debhelper.log
*.substvars
autoreconf.before
autoreconf.after
.tmp/
.debhelper/
tmp/
plank/
libplank1/
libplank-common/
libplank-dev/
plank-docklets/
